OL,3,GNEWSACouncil home ceiling falls twice
OL,4,Ain eight months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south London mum who was injured
OL,7,Fafter the ceiling in her council house
OL,8,Fcollapsed for a second time in eight
OL,9,Fmonths says she is still waiting for
OL,10,Frepairs.
OL,12,FThe ceiling at Venesha Rose's home in
OL,13,FGipsy Hill first gave way in January,
OL,14,Fnarrowly missing her three-year-old
OL,15,Fdaughter. They were moved into
OL,16,Ftemporary accommodation and returned
OL,17,Fhome in May.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
