OL,3,GNEWSACouncil home ceiling falls twice
OL,4,Ain eight months
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the ceiling collapsed again in
OL,7,FAugust, leaving Rose and her nephew
OL,8,Fneeding hospital treatment. Rose said
OL,9,Frepairs carried out after the first
OL,10,Ftime had failed to address the
OL,11,Funderlying cause.
OL,13,FLambeth Council said a senior surveyor
OL,14,Fvisited the property "immediately"
OL,15,Fafter the latest collapse and the
OL,16,Fauthority had been working to repair it
OL,17,Fsince.
